{
  "an5.47:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 5.47 ",
  "an5.47:0.2": "5. Muṇḍarājavagga ",
  "an5.47:0.3": "Dhanasutta ",
  "an5.47:1.1": "“Pañcimāni, bhikkhave, dhanāni. ",
  "an5.47:1.2": "Katamāni pañca? ",
  "an5.47:1.3": "Saddhādhanaṁ, sīladhanaṁ, sutadhanaṁ, cāgadhanaṁ, paññādhanaṁ. ",
  "an5.47:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, saddhādhanaṁ? ",
  "an5.47:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako saddho hoti, saddahati tathāgatassa bodhiṁ: ",
  "an5.47:2.3": "‘itipi so bhagavā …pe… satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā’ti. ",
  "an5.47:2.4": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, saddhādhanaṁ. ",
  "an5.47:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, sīladhanaṁ? ",
  "an5.47:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako pāṇātipātā paṭivirato hoti …pe… surāmerayamajjapamādaṭṭhānā paṭivirato hoti. ",
  "an5.47:3.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, sīladhanaṁ. ",
  "an5.47:4.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, sutadhanaṁ? ",
  "an5.47:4.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako bahussuto hoti …pe… diṭṭhiyā suppaṭividdho. ",
  "an5.47:4.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, sutadhanaṁ. ",
  "an5.47:5.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, cāgadhanaṁ? ",
  "an5.47:5.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako vigatamalamaccherena cetasā agāraṁ ajjhāvasati muttacāgo payatapāṇi vosaggarato yācayogo dānasaṁvibhāgarato. ",
  "an5.47:5.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, cāgadhanaṁ. ",
  "an5.47:6.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, paññādhanaṁ? ",
  "an5.47:6.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako paññav�